{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3662","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3662","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3662\",\"parent_revision\":\"01ab738400eb4fec7c2a175a55e543a9ca38ef1a0776056db2aa6be628d1980f\",\"root_revision\":\"01ab738400eb4fec7c2a175a55e543a9ca38ef1a0776056db2aa6be628d1980f\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-09-19\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n`/dh:complete-implementation` calls `backlog_resolve` as its terminal step (per `work-backlog-item/references/workflows/work/post-planning.md`), which closes the issue. Nothing in that sequence requires the PR carrying the fix to be merged first. Merging a PR needs explicit repo-owner approval in this repository, so a dh run can reach `complete-implementation` while the PR is open.\\n\\nObserved while planning #3060 (plan P7ca8d7aa, `autonomy: full_auto`): acceptance criterion 8 requires the change to be on `origin/main`; only the owner can merge PR #3649; the plan's T99 verification and `complete-implementation` can both run before that merge. The plan validator noted TN would report AC 8 as FAIL in that case, but nothing stops `complete-implementation` from resolving the issue after it.\\n\\nThe same failure already happened once: plan Pe6bcc5c2 for #3060 reported 100% complete while its work existed only on an unpushed local branch.\\n\\nImpact: issues close while their fix is not on the default branch; the backlog then reports work as done that is not shipped.\\n\\nRelated: #3096 (monitor a PR through review to closure), #3219 (closing-keyword policy), #3220 (verify a PR resolves its issue).\\n\\nExpected: an issue is resolved only after the change that satisfies its acceptance criteria is on the default branch.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session observation, planning of #3060, 2026-09-20\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-19\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"6c97882f04236683190de694c653a7382080939cea893b028317614cb3dfb658\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVoHlIw\"}"}